<%- include('partials/header') %><h1>Text worker and models</h1><div class="grid"><article><h2>Readiness</h2><strong class="<%= status.ready?'ok':'bad' %>"><%= status.ready?'Ready':'Unavailable' %></strong></article><article><h2>Configured model</h2><strong><%= configuredModel %></strong><p><%= status.model ? status.model.pipes.join(', ') : 'Not loaded' %></p></article><article><h2>Completed</h2><strong><%= status.completed %></strong><p>Average <%= status.averageDurationMs ?? '—' %> ms</p></article><article><h2>Failed / restarts</h2><strong><%= status.failed %> / <%= status.restarts %></strong></article></div><p>No transformer or generative model is loaded. The worker uses spaCy's CPU pipeline, deterministic rules, TF-IDF, NMF, and extractive ranking.</p><%- include('partials/footer') %>
